    {
      "what": "external 5 V supply budget at full brightness",
      "why": "With all 256 LEDs lit at maximum intensity and 10 kohm RSET, four chained MAX7219 ICs can draw over 1 A. Powering a 4-in-1 module from an Arduino 5V pin works at moderate intensity or sparse text, as on a bench, while full-screen high-intensity patterns can overload a USB 5V rail."
